.SS "int meta_internal (noir_md * md, const char * file, const char * grp)"
.PP
meta_internal - must be implemented by the hosting application! 
.PP
this will take care of meta-data intrinsic to evidence and those handled by the file-system backend, but will not handle data created by meta-data plugins. 
.PP
\fBReturns:\fP
.RS 4
an error-code 
.RE
.PP
\fBParameters:\fP
.RS 4
\fImd\fP the meta-data to set 
.br
\fIfile\fP the file we want to update 
.br
\fIgrp\fP the group of meta-data we're supposed to handle now
.RE
.PP

